    "text": "r \n• Developed a cross-platform Flutter app integrated with FastAPI backend serving EfficientNet-B0 deep \nlearning model for fish identification. \n• Implemented camera integration, real-time image classification, and similarity search with confidence \nscores. \n• Designed modern Material Design UI with smooth animations supporting Android, iOS, and Web platforms. \n \nAI E-Commerce Assistant \n• Developed an AI-powered E-Commerce Assistant that understands natural language queries and recommends \nproducts using TF-IDF and cosine similarity. \n• Implemented intent detection and category validation to handle product search, comparisons, and \nprevent AI hallucinations. \n• Built a complete system with FastAPI backend and chat-based frontend, including sentiment analysis of \nproduct reviews for explainable recommendations. \n \nEDUCATION \n• B.Tech in Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning, CHARUSAT University, Gujarat, India \n– Aug 2023 – Present (Expected Graduation: May 2027) \n– CGPA: 8.56 /",
